# This repo is authored and edited on Windows, macOS and Linux, so it commits one convention instead
# of preserving whatever each writer produced: LF in the repository, always.
#
# Without this, a tool that writes CRLF on Windows turns a small edit into a whole-file diff. Measured
# while writing this repo: a 32-line change arrived as 730 insertions and 712 deletions.
#
# This is deliberately the OPPOSITE of the `* -text` the kit recommends for a vault of notes. There the
# files pre-exist, are mixed, and are edited by hand, so normalising rewrites files nobody touched.
# Here every file is authored in this repo and consistency costs nothing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
